cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to OnePass, please cite it as below."
title: "OnePass"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Soma Labs"
abstract: >-
  OnePass is an open source, post-quantum password manager for iPhone, iPad,
  Mac, Apple Watch and Vision Pro. A Rust core seals every item with
  AES-256-GCM-SIV, wraps vault keys with hybrid ML-KEM-1024 + X25519, signs
  manifests with hybrid ML-DSA-87 + Ed25519 and anchors accounts with
  SLH-DSA, and syncs end to end encrypted through the user's private iCloud.
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/soma-intelligence/onepass"
url: "https://somalabs.me/onepass"
keywords:
  - password manager
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ML-KEM
  - ML-DSA
  - SLH-DSA
  - passkeys
  - end-to-end encryption
  - iOS
  - macOS
  - Rust
